<h2><strong>Keeping Families Close </strong></h2>
<p class="short">"We believe that when families are together, they cope better. </p>
<p>We believe no family should have to deal with their child’s medical crisis alone. </p>
<p>Having a child in hospital is unimaginable for families. At Ronald McDonald House Charities Cyprus,  we ease some of the burden by providing free ‘home away from home’ accommodation."</p>

<h2><strong>How RMHC Help</strong>s</h2>
<p>"We provide essential services that remove barriers, strengthen families and promote healing when children need healthcare. </p>
<p>Thanks to our supporters and fundraisers, we help families whose children are facing a long hospital stay away from home. </p>
<p>As an independent charity, we rely on the support and generosity of our volunteers, fundraisers  and donors to keep families close to their sick children in hospital each year."</p>

